{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50071","headline":"句 · 道彦","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风起竹间萤影乱，月明江上笛声多。\n夜静槛前调绿绮，日高窗下戴乌纱。\n渔艇远飘沧海上，草堂深锁白云间。\n柴门半掩潮光里，野径斜分草色中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道彦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}